Based on the provided scene images, here is an analysis following the requested format.

### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:scene1234 a ex:TrafficScene ;
    ex:hasEntity ex:van123 ;
    ex:hasEntity ex:pedestrian456 ;
    ex:hasEntity ex:barrel789 ;
    ex:hasEntity ex:roadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:nightTime .

ex:van123 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:nearSideOfRoad .

ex:pedestrian456 a ex:Person ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:nearBarrel .

ex:barrel789 a ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:hasState ex:tipOver .

ex:roadInfrastructure a ex:Road ;
    ex:hasLane ex:singleLane .
    
ex:nightTime a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:hasVisibility ex:low .
```

